IT Asset Submission Acknowledgement Application
Proposed Enhancements & Future Roadmap
Purpose

The objective is to enhance the existing IT Asset Submission Acknowledgement application while keeping the current workflow intact. The application is already functional and widely usable, so the focus is on improving automation, usability, audit compliance, document management, and future integration capabilities.

The proposal below is intended for discussion and design review with management and development teams.

Current Design Principles

The following existing functionality must remain unchanged:

AD Lookup functionality
Business Unit (BU) template management
Word template processing
PDF generation
Digital signature workflow
Topaz signature support
Email draft generation
Bulk processing
Existing user experience

All enhancements should be additive and backward compatible.

